'''Ghost Snache''' (ゴーストにょろ ''Gōsuto Nyoro'', '''Ghost Nyoro''') is one of the '''Ghost Gang''' members (ゴーストマスターズ ''Gōsutomasutāzu'', '''Ghost Masters''') that are introduced in [[Ghostly Houseguests (Monthly Event)|Ghostly Houseguests]]. It also appears in [[The Haunted 1LDK]], the final stage of [[Mouseyland]]. It was added in [[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

