==Enemy==
Ghost Snache is the [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Snache]], and is two times more powerful in terms of health and damage. It's still very easy to deal with, though.

==Strategy==
Since it is only twice as strong as the regular Snache, almost anything can kill it with ease.

