==Trivia==
*Ghost Snache's headwear is a [https://skdesu.com/en/hitaikakushi-the-mysterious-white-cloth-japanese/ hitaikakushi], a triangular white headdress common among Japanese depictions of ghosts.
*The blue flames next to it are [[wikipedia:Hitodama|hitodama]], which traditionally surround Japanese ghosts and those they possess.
*Due to the near-identical katakana spellings, the Ghost Gang's Japanese name, Ghost Masters (ゴーストマスターズ ''Gōsutomasutāzu''), may be a reference to the movie ''[[wikipedia:Ghostbusters|Ghostbusters]]'' (ゴーストバスターズ ''Gōsutobasutāzu'').
*Ghost Snache, [[Ghost Doge]] and [[Ghost Baa Baa]] are the only monthly event enemies to appear in [[Stories of Legend]], all in [[The Haunted 1LDK]].
**Additionally, they and the [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]] are the only enemies in Stories of Legend without descriptions.
*Ghost Snache, Ghost Doge, Ghost Baa Baa, [[Angel Fanboy]] and [[Idi:Re]] are the only enemies in Stories of Legend that do not appear in Uncanny Legends.
**Idi:Re is the only one that was not introduced in an event stage.

